with another set of eyes.\r\n\r\nThere's a few things that could be checked out if going to town for performance, but probably not necessary.\r\n\r\nFor instance you could evaluate whether checking both conditions with:\r\n```\r\nif (ABS(d) > ALMOST_ONE)\r\n```\r\nMade a difference. You could then do a second check for polarity.\r\nThe idea being ABS cheaper than a comparison. But that would require looking at assembly / profiles and I don't think it's necessary unless someone is super keen.\r\n\r\nBy the way, can confirm compiler uses two separate constants for the positive and negative, I checked the assembly.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101797#pullrequestreview-2561018359","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101797","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-01-19T14:14:43Z"},{"id":2561083868,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Ypwnc","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?u=c2e06a3d2b49a467aa907e54aa259516440267cc&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","login":"fire","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101797#pullrequestreview-2561083868","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101797","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-01-19T20:26:55Z"},{"id":2561792179,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Ysdiz","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"27e23280c55958a3f3eb2f21d9f2a2e835fccaa9","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?u=2b8b17ce969861380874563b333a546e0bbaab56&v=4","created_at":"0001